# Line-ending policy (repository level).
#
# These files MUST be LF in the worktree:
#   * .sh                     -> a CRLF shebang breaks `bash ops/wsl_up.sh`
#                                under WSL ("$'\r': command not found") and
#                                container exec ("exec /app/entrypoint.sh:
#                                no such file or directory" — the kernel goes
#                                looking for "/bin/sh\r").
#   * Dockerfile / *.yml      -> same class of breakage (entrypoint, apt
#                                sources, buildx/compose parsing).
#
# This machine runs core.autocrlf=true, so without this file git rewrites
# every checkout of these files to CRLF and silently re-breaks the WSL and
# container start scripts. Keep this file in the repo.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
